      "For more than 24 years, I have seen how music can change a student's life. It can help a child express emotions, build discipline, make new friends, and discover a stronger sense of self.": "二十四年來，我親眼看見音樂可以怎樣改變學生的人生。它可以幫助孩子表達情感、建立紀律、認識朋友，並找到更強的自我。",
      "This is one of the reasons I founded Music Fun 100.": "這正是我創立 Music Fun 100 的原因之一。",
